+Two warnings the fixture also produced are left out of the table above because they are properties of the fixture, not of these designs: `W-DATA-CLUSTER-UNDECLARED` on `age_band`, an artifact of the synthetic table's own three-band shape rather than of `growth-screen`'s real roster; and, on E5 specifically, `W-REPL-DETERMINISTIC`, an artifact of the demo entrypoint's step not declaring `nondeterministic = True` where the real `step03_screen` is described as declaring it (§ E4 — Reasoning-effort operational benchmark). Neither bears on `E-DATA-HOLDOUT-UNSUPPORTED`, `E-DATA-RESOLVER-UNSUPPORTED`, or `E-DATA-WEIGHT-CONTRAST`.
